                "description": "The Round Knob with Rectangular Rose will be the perfect finishing touch to any mid-century modern home. There is a knob for every door in your house; choose from passage, privacy, or dummy functions. Emtek's Round Knob with Modern Rectangular Rosette comes in a wide array of finish colors including satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, and polished chrome. This Modern Brass Round Knobset with Rectangular Rosette will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "Round Knob with Modern Rectangular Rosettes, Round Knob with Rectangular Roses, Emtek 5052ROU, Emtek 5112ROU, Emtek 5212ROU, EMT-5052ROU, modern knobsets, contemporary knobs, Modern Round Knob and rectangular Roses, Helsinki knobs, Contemporary rectangular Rose with Round Knobs, Modern Brass Round Knobset with rectangular Rosettes, mid-century modern door knobs, Modern Round Knob and Rectangle Roses,  Contemporary Round Knob with Rectangle Roesttes, Modern Brass Round Knobset with Rectangular Rosettes,"
